## FineTuningApi

### Immediately cancel a fine-tune job. 
## Immediately cancel a fine-tune job. 
POST https://api.openai.com/v1/fine_tuning/jobs/{{fine_tuning_job_id}}/cancel
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Creates a fine-tuning job which begins the process of creating a new model from a given dataset.  Response includes details of the enqueued job including job status and the name of the fine-tuned models once complete.  [Learn more about fine-tuning](/docs/guides/fine-tuning) 
## Creates a fine-tuning job which begins the process of creating a new model from a given dataset.  Response includes details of the enqueued job including job status and the name of the fine-tuned models once complete.  [Learn more about fine-tuning](/docs/guides/fine-tuning) 
POST https://api.openai.com/v1/fine_tuning/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

{
 "model": "<string>",
 "training_file": "<string>",
 "hyperparameters": "<string>",
 "suffix": "<string>",
 "validation_file": "<string>",
 "integrations": "<string>",
 "seed": "<number>",
 "method": "<string>"
}


### Get status updates for a fine-tuning job. 
## Get status updates for a fine-tuning job. 
GET https://api.openai.com/v1/fine_tuning/jobs/{{fine_tuning_job_id}}/events?after={{after}}&limit={{limit}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### List checkpoints for a fine-tuning job. 
## List checkpoints for a fine-tuning job. 
GET https://api.openai.com/v1/fine_tuning/jobs/{{fine_tuning_job_id}}/checkpoints?after={{after}}&limit={{limit}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### List your organization&#39;s fine-tuning jobs 
## List your organization&#39;s fine-tuning jobs 
GET https://api.openai.com/v1/fine_tuning/jobs?after={{after}}&limit={{limit}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Get info about a fine-tuning job.  [Learn more about fine-tuning](/docs/guides/fine-tuning) 
## Get info about a fine-tuning job.  [Learn more about fine-tuning](/docs/guides/fine-tuning) 
GET https://api.openai.com/v1/fine_tuning/jobs/{{fine_tuning_job_id}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
